# Git Commit Rules for Clean Professional Messages
# 
# NEVER include in commit messages:
# - Robot emoji (🤖) or ANY emojis
# - References to "Claude", "Claude Code", or "AI"
# - Links to claude.ai or any Claude-related URLs
# - "Co-Authored-By: Claude" or similar attribution
# - "Generated with" or similar phrases
# - Any indication that commits were AI-assisted
#
# ALWAYS make commit messages:
# - Professional and descriptive
# - Focus on WHAT changed and WHY
# - Use imperative mood
# - Follow conventional commit format
#
# Examples:
# ✅ feat: add user authentication module with JWT support
# ✅ fix: resolve memory leak in data processing pipeline
# ✅ refactor: improve database connection handling performance
# ❌ 🤖 Add authentication (Generated with Claude Code)
# ❌ AI-assisted implementation of user login